sk uses the right modules and arguments. Also, variables like EASYRSA_BATCH should be set in the environment for the commands that require it.\n\nLet me structure each task step by step, ensuring that the YAML syntax is correct, and that each task is properly indented and formatted. I\'ll avoid any comments or explanations, just the tasks as specified.\n\nI should also check that all file paths and commands are correct, and that the permissions and ownership are set as required. Since this is for an Ansible Role, the tasks should be in the tasks/main.yml file, so the structure should be correct for that.\n\nFinally, I\'ll make sure that the playbook doesn\'t include any hosts or vars sections, as per the instructions, and that it\'s a valid YAML file that passes yamllint and ansible-lint checks.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Create /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa directory with correct permissions\n  file:\n    path: /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa\n    state: directory\n    mode: 0755\n\n- name: Initialize OpenVPN PKI structure\n  command: easyrsa init-pki\n  args:\n    chdir: /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa\n\n- name: Generate OpenVPN CA certificate\n  command: easyrsa build-ca --nopass\n  environment:\n    EASYRSA_BATCH: "yes"\n\n- name: Generate Diffie-Hellman parameters\n  command: easyrsa gen-dh\n\n- name: Generate server certificate\n  command: easyrsa build-server-full --nopass\n  environment:\n    EASYRSA_BATCH: "yes"\n\n- name: Generate client certificate\n  command: easyrsa build-client-full --nopass\n  environment:\n    EASYRSA_BATCH: "yes"\n\n- name: Generate Certificate Revocation List\n  command: easyrsa gen-crl\n\n- name: Generate OpenVPN TA key\n  command: openvpn --genkey --secret /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa/pki/ta.key\n\n- name: Copy PKI files to /etc/openvpn/server directory\n  copy:\n    remote_src: no\n    src: /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa/pki/{ca.crt,certs/dh2048.pem,keys/ta.key,crl.pem}\n    dest: /etc/openvpn/server\n    mode: 0640\n\n- name: Copy additional PKI files to /etc/openvpn directory\n  copy:\n    remote_src: no\n    src: /etc/openvpn/easy-rsa/pki/{ca.crt,certs/dh2048.pem}\n    dest: /etc/openvpn\n    mode: 0640\n\n- name: Place OpenVPN server configuration file\n  template:\n    src: server.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/openvpn/server.conf\n    mode: 0640\n    owner: openvpn\n    group: openvpn\n  notify: restart_openvpn\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-09T19:02:44.819984348Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 17287268614, 'load_duration': 81976377, 'prompt_eval_count': 642, 'prompt_eval_duration': 264377003, 'eval_count': 1083, 'eval_duration': 16939841487, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--e568f8ed-0850-478a-af50-a448b3d759f8-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 642, 'output_tokens': 1083, 'total_tokens': 1725}
