  when: (ansible_os_family == 'Debian' or ansible_distribution in ['Ubuntu', 'Debian']) or (ansible_os_family == 'RedHat' or ansible_distribution in ['CentOS', 'Fedora', 'RHEL'])
  apt:
    name: "{{ hashicorp_pkg_name }}"
    state: present
    update_cache: yes
  yum:
    name: "{{ hashicorp_pkg_name }}"
    state: present
```

This corrected code ensures that the 'when' condition is properly evaluated as a boolean, avoids duplication, and maintains line length standards.


